{"word":"συμπαθής","uri":"sumpathês","senses":[{"word":"συμπαθής","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">συμ·παθής,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ής, ές</span>\n[<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ᾰ</span>]\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> <span class=\"ital\">intr. :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> qui prend sa part de la\nsouffrance d’autrui, qui éprouve de la compassion, de la sympathie,\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat. com.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2-2, 686\nMein.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\next.</span> qui éprouve les mêmes sentiments que, <span class=\"ital\">dat.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Probl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">19, 40 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 5, 13 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de choses</span> (<span class=\"ital\">âme, corps,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Physiogn.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4,\n2 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">nerfs,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Anth.</span> <span class=\"refch\">11, 352</span>) ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> <span class=\"ital\">tr.</span> qui excite la compassion, la sympathie,\n<span class=\"aut\">DH.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 45</span>\n||</div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Cp.</span> <span class=\"grec\">συμπαθέστερος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat. com.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">l. c. ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">M. Tyr.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">7, 4 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">sup.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">συμπαθέστατος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">P.A.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 7, 19</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">σ. πάθος</span>.</div>\n"}]}